 "remarks": "Welcome to Hamilton Way, Unit 8, a 2,500 SF, 2-BD, 2.5-BA end-unit townhome offering exceptional space, thoughtful updates & low-maintenance living. The gracious dining room with coffered ceiling adjoins the vaulted living room. The '23-renovated gourmet kitchen features custom cabinetry, Bosch appliances, a walk-in pantry & opens into the family room with fireplace. Upstairs, the private primary suite features a sitting area & fireplace; 2nd-floor laundry adds convenience. The expansive lower level offers exceptional storage & flexible space for a gym, hobbies or future needs. Outdoors, a private bluestone patio is surrounded by mature, multi-season landscaping. New roof, gutters & complete HVAC. Exceptionally clean & move-in ready. Near restaurants, shopping, downtown Greenwich & train.",
